  "details": "Please remove through upload animations that forces stuff on your screen.\nWhatever this is flashing or zoom or other effects that are forcefully stuckt directly onto your screen.\nMaybe not as easily on desktop, but in VR this can cause seizures very easily that users cannot escape easily from or turn away from if their safety settings werent on.\nAlot of people dont realise the harm this creates for bieng photosensitive or people having epilepsy.\nOr just people getting really motion sick and unable to do jack shit against some effects because it distorts the screen so much they cant see their menu properly.\nI dont get why this is even an allowed thing in VRChat in the first place to allow things bieng forcefully stuckt onto your personal screen.\nWhatever you do around you is one thing, if people can turn away or avoid you or actually use their menu to block your avatar or something else.\nBut things stuckt to someones screen forcefully is not okay.",
